5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m a bit nervous about starting, but I want to understand why past projects stalled. Who else feels the ownership gap is our biggest risk?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Midori, ownership gaps matter, but I’m more concerned about operational continuity. The depot floor doesn’t pause for software migrations. We need to prioritize real-world workflow compatibility first.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, continuity is key, but don’t ignore the tech debt. We can’t just patch over aging systems forever. Who else sees that risk?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I worry about the people holding this together. If we stretch them thin during the switch, the whole thing collapses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
