10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that cost jump is alarming. I’m worried about hidden fees. @May, how do we ensure the new plan stays realistic for our team?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
