14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, hidden fees are just the tip of the iceberg. I’m digging into the board minutes to see how capital requests are actually approved versus refused.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that sounds serious. I’m worried about who actually owns the system when things break. I’ll check the support ownership during the last winter’s outage.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
